# Changes to these paths need a review from the releasers team before they can
# land on master (enforced by the "Protect master" ruleset). They either control
# CI and these rules themselves, or run inside the job that publishes the gem.
#
# Keep this file in .github/: GitHub reads it before a CODEOWNERS file in the
# repo root or docs/, and /.github/ below means changes to it need a releaser too.
#
# To require a releaser's review on every change, add this line above the others:
# *  @danger/releasers

/.github/               @danger/releasers
/danger.gemspec         @danger/releasers
/lib/danger/version.rb  @danger/releasers
